==Russian==

===Etymology===
In the meaning "exile", from {{af|ru|ссыла́ть|t1=to [[exile]]|-ка}}; in the meaning "reference", from {{af|ru|ссылаться|alt1=ссыла́ть(ся)|t1=to [[refer]] to|-ка}} .

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|ссы́лка}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-ссылка.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|ссы́лка|*|adj=ссы́лочный|dim=ссы́лочка|expr=ссыль}}

# [[reference]]
# {{lb|ru|computing}} [[link]]
# {{lb|ru|history}} [[exile]], [[banishment]] {{gloss|the state of being banished from one's home or country}}

